Spec: ProjectModel
Purpose: Semantic mirror of the real project.
SourceRoot: ..
Structure:
  BE: backend source tree
  FE: frontend source tree
  MD: mobile source tree
  DB: database assets/schema
  DO: infrastructure/deployment assets
Rules:
  This tree mirrors source paths semantically.
  It MUST NOT contain implementation code.
  It MUST NOT become a second runtime source of truth.
  Each map node points to real source location and dependencies.
  AI navigates this model before broad source search.
